WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.939 --> 00:00:06.160
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and for my bonus
Marvel video this week we need to talk about

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:10.740
the Death of SHIELD and how it affects potential
stories for Captain America 3 and Avengers

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:11.740
Age of Ultron.

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:15.469
It all ties into something Kevin Feige said
recently.

00:00:15.469 --> 00:00:20.570
He talked about how they wanted the Avengers
to face this new Ultron threat without the

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:24.110
benefit of an international organization like
SHIELD.

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:27.610
The really cool thing is that Marvel has already
done a big story like this, called Secret

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:28.740
Avengers.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:30.880
Real quick though, if you’re finding me
for the first time.

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:32.550
I do bonus Marvel videos every week.

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:36.579
Normally on Tuesdays, be sure to subscribe
to get everything and leave me suggestions

00:00:36.579 --> 00:00:38.679
for future topics in the comments.

00:00:38.679 --> 00:00:42.379
So let’s ask a really big question.

00:00:42.379 --> 00:00:46.729
What happens to Captain America and The Avengers
when SHIELD doesn’t exist anymore?

00:00:46.729 --> 00:00:49.039
First let’s talk about the end of Winter
Soldier.

00:00:49.039 --> 00:00:51.899
Chris Evans and Nick Fury said two very important
things.

00:00:51.899 --> 00:00:53.929
Well, they actually said the same thing essentially.

00:00:53.929 --> 00:00:56.860
They’re going to conduct new missions on
their own, off the grid.

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:57.860
SHIELD having been the Grid so to speak.

00:00:57.860 --> 00:01:01.359
Nick Fury was headed after the remnants of
HYDRA and Captain America was going after

00:01:01.359 --> 00:01:02.359
Bucky to try and rehabilitate him.

00:01:02.359 --> 00:01:06.800
The same is true for the rest of the non-HYDRA
people that left to join other teams, like

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:10.580
Maria Hill joining Stark Industries and Sharon
Carter joining the CIA.

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:14.150
This mirrors some of the things that happened
in the comics in the wake of the Civil War

00:01:14.150 --> 00:01:15.150
storyline.

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:18.560
After which Norman Osborn took over SHIELD
and rebranded it as HAMMER.

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:22.690
Then came Dark Avengers and Secret Avengers.

00:01:22.690 --> 00:01:26.210
Secret Avengers was essentially the story
of Captain America putting his own team together.

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:32.900
Here’s where it gets more interesting as
it applies to a potential Captain America

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:34.660
3 story.

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:40.360
The first Secret Avengers team he assembled
included Beast, War Machine, Valkyrie, Moon

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:46.180
Knight, Nova, Black Widow, Sharon Carter,
and Ant-Man.

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:50.680
So right off the bat we have to toss out Beast
because FOX copyright and they haven’t introduced

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:52.560
Valkyrie in the movie universe yet.

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:56.120
She could always be replaced by Sif since
she’s also an Asgardian.

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:59.270
Moon Knight is someone that hasn’t made
it into the movies yet either.

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:01.370
Nova could always come via Guardians of The
Galaxy.

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:06.230
All the other members we’ve met or will
meet before Captain America 3 is released.

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:12.140
Next big question, realistically if they did
Secret Avengers as the plot of Captain America

00:02:12.140 --> 00:02:15.900
3, what would the actual team be and what
would they be doing.

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:20.700
Remember, the movie is going to come right
after Ant-Man in 2016.

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:24.790
So we’ll have had Guardians of the Galaxy,
Avengers 2 and Ant Man.

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:27.760
So a lot of new characters and potential stories.

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:29.950
Let’s talk roster.

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:35.650
Captain America can only pick from existing
Avengers and other characters we’ve met.

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:37.790
Based on the original team here’s what we
could see.

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:42.620
Don Cheadle as War Machine, Jaimie Alexander
as Sif, someone from the Nova Corps in Guardians

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:47.959
of the Galaxy, Scarlett Johansson as Black
Widow, Emily Van Camp as Sharon Carter and

00:02:47.959 --> 00:02:49.280
Paul Rudd as Ant Man.

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:53.900
Now let’s get a little more realistic and
shorten that list a little.

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:56.560
Casting that many actors would make it feel
like a real Avengers Movie, and it’s supposed

00:02:56.560 --> 00:02:59.490
to be a Captain America movie.

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:03.120
So let’s just take Black Widow, Sharon Carter
and Lady Sif.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.990
Wouldn’t that be crazy.

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:07.500
Captain America and a badass team of Marvel
Women.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.060
It would be like Charlie’s Angels.

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:11.540
I don’t think they’re going to do that.

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:12.709
But it’s fun to imagine.

00:03:12.709 --> 00:03:16.099
I’d swap Sif for Paul Rudd just to balance
it out.

00:03:16.099 --> 00:03:17.260
Now let’s talk plot.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:23.810
In Secret Avengers the villains evolve into
the Masters of Evil, which I think we’ll

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:25.680
see in some form in the movies eventually.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:30.521
There are a ton of volumes in that comic series,
but in general since Captain America is a

00:03:30.521 --> 00:03:31.650
very earth based super hero.

00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:35.540
I think any of the characters or story arcs
they pull out will be more like Winter Soldier.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:39.630
More Bourne Identity than spaceships and aliens
like some of the other Marvel movies.

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:43.160
The takeaway from all this Winter Soldier
SHIELD stuff is that Captain America will

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:46.480
be putting his own covert team together and
his next mission will be them traveling around

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:52.680
dealing with Masters of Evil, more HYDRA and
possibly getting tied up in whatever Nick

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:53.680
Fury is up to.

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:55.270
He’s actually a big part of the story in
Secret Avengers.

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:57.940
So if you want to learn more just read that
comic.

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:00.840
Let’s move on to what all this means for
Avengers 2.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:04.920
Because like I said Marvel implied that SHIELD
would still be on extended smoke break when

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:07.720
Ultron comes.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:10.750
We already know a lot about what’s going
on in the movie and who the big characters

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:11.750
are.

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:15.709
We even saw Captain America and Hawkeye’s
new suits and Iron Man’s new Armor.

00:04:15.709 --> 00:04:17.489
We even know what Ultron looks like.

00:04:17.489 --> 00:04:22.010
But the destruction of SHIELD opens up a lot
of possibilities for how the story will progress.

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:26.330
If they stick with Secret Avengers we’ll
get to see Captain America traveling around

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:28.460
to everyone from the first movie to get them
back on the team.

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:31.600
And in case it wasn’t clear after Thor The
Dark World, Thor is living on earth.

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:33.930
So all of the Avengers are closer than ever
before.

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:35.740
And Stark Tower will be finished.

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:38.380
We saw a peek of it during Winter Soldier.

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:43.090
That means the real problem won’t be making
them all play nice, it will be finding the

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:45.030
resources to fight Utron.

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:49.860
If only there were a billionaire industrialist
playboy philanthropist nearby who just hired

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:54.620
SHIELD’s former second in command.

00:04:54.620 --> 00:05:00.800
So they will have all of Iron Man’s resources
at their disposal, but if Ultron is capable

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:05.050
of co-opting electrical systems we need to
think about how that will affect all the Stark

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:06.050
Tech.

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:07.050
We did see the Hulkbuster fighting Hulk in
the concept footage.

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:08.810
It’s possible that could be Ultron just
using the suit.

00:05:08.810 --> 00:05:12.440
And then there’s the birth of Vision.

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:15.620
Ultron creates Vision in the comic books,
but we don’t know if they’ll do it that

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:16.950
way in the movies.

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:20.870
And if Tesseract Energy is going to play a
role.

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:25.810
If you didn’t catch the Baron Von Strucker
reference during Captain America, Loki’s

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:29.840
staff and tesseract energy were responsible
for Quicksilver and Scarlet Witch getting

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:30.990
their powers.

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:39.260
That’s a big departure from the comics,
but I have a feeling the birth of Ultron and

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:44.400
Vision will be loosely related to tesseract
energy interacting with Stark Tech.

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:50.870
Let me know what your answer is, how is Stark
Industries going to step in and fill the SHIELD

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:56.270
void when Avengers 2 gets here.

